  "description": "In spring, as cherry blossoms drift in the air, Chan-Young, a 20-year-old repeat student, has his earphones hooked to the zipper of a 27-year-old postal clerk, Mi-Sun. \n\nIn summer, as trees offer shade, a charming male doctor, Jun-Sung, plays cupid to Min-Hee and Gan-Gi, a pair of seemingly longtime lovers. \n\nIn autumn, as red maple leaves decorate the blue sky, Gyeong-Tae, Jeong-Mi's ex-boyfriend, a web comic writer, suddenly appears at her doorstep. He's back. \n\nIn winter, as heavy snow blankets the earth, Soo-Heon, the chef of Gom Restaurant, meets a young woman in a rural guesthouse in Gangwon-do during a snowy day... \n\n(Source: WeComics)",
